      "Add assertions to verify that `test_async_behavior` is actually defined and callable within the extracted module, ensuring it's more than just a name match."
    ]
  },
  "fast": {
    "score": 9,
    "rationale": "The test executes in milliseconds. It avoids sleeps, heavy I/O (other than file write), or network calls.",
    "suggestions": []
